        "comments": "The assembly veEquPalu1.hap1.1 is based on 41x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process began with initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode. Scaffolding of the primary (hap1) contigs was done in three phases: SALSA2 with no-breaking, followed by Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS (no-breaking and excluding contigs <30kb), and finally another round of Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS (run on all scaffolds and contig breaking allowed). The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size.",
